    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "You can add a card to your hand. As long as one of the Digimon cards revealed has either [Shoutmon] or ＜Blitz＞, you can add it to your hand.",
        "question": "If the 5 cards revealed with this card's effect don't include both a Digimon card with [Shoutmon] and a Digimon card with ＜Blitz＞, am I allowed to add one of the cards to my hand, or do both cards have to be present?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, [BT5-019 ShoutmonDX] has [Shoutmon], and it also has ＜Blitz＞. The effect is looking for \"1 Digimon card with [Shoutmon] and 1 Digimon card with ＜Blitz＞,\" which means you can add both to your hand.",
        "question": "If the 5 cards revealed with this card's effect include 2 copies of [BT5-019 ShoutmonDX], can I add both copies to my hand?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No. Even if there was only one Digimon card with either \"Shoutmon\" in its name or a Digimon card with \"Advancement\", it will be added to your hand.",
        "question": "Does the effect of this card require both a Digimon card with \"Shoutmon\" in its name and a Digimon card with \"Advance\" in its name among the 5 cards revealed to be added to my hand?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, \"BT5-019 Shoutmon DX\" contains \"Shoutmon\" in its name and has \"Advance\", so you can put both cards in your hand as \"a Digimon card containing \"Shoutmon\" in its name and a Digimon card with \"Advance\".",
        "question": "If there are two \"BT5-019 Shoutmon DX\" among the five cards revealed, can the effect of this card put both of those cards into my hand?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "One card with \"Shoutmon\" in its name and one card with \"Advancement\".",
        "question": "Which card is added to your hand by this card's [On Play] effect?",
        "reference": "[3]"
      }
    ]
  },
